# MegaLens operator manual (every agent)

**Full doc:** `QuestTracker-Modded/MEGALENS_AUDITOR_AGENT.md`

**MCP server:** `user-megalens` — tools: `megalens_debate`, `megalens_poll`, `megalens_history`, `megalens_status`

**Before any MCP call:** read schema in `mcps/user-megalens/tools/<tool>.json`

---

## All tools — every parameter

### `megalens_debate` — start async audit

| Param | Required | Default | Values / rules |
|-------|----------|---------|----------------|
| `prompt` | **YES** | — | Specific P0/P1 questions; max 5–8 findings with `file:line`. Not "audit everything." |
| `fileContext` | No | omit | **Full file text** — paths/summaries → `MCP_BLOCKED`, `files_mapped: 0` |
| `skill` | No | auto | `code_intelligence` (Lua mods), `research`, `security_audit`, `seo`, `saas_launch`, `wordpress`, `legal`, `general` |
| `tier` | No | `free` | `free` (2+1), `standard` (3+2 ~$0.22), `deep` (5+3 — needs `confirmDeep`) |
| `mode` | No | `quick` | `quick` = 1 engine. `multi` = debate — **requires `tier` ≥ `standard`** |
| `confirmDeep` | No | `false` | `true` only if user explicitly wants deep + accepts cost |
| `detail` | No | shaped | Only `"full"` — raw debug payload |

**Tier map:**

| Level | `tier` | `mode` | Cost | Use |
|-------|--------|--------|------|-----|
| L1 | `free` | `quick` | $0 | One suspicion |
| L2 | `free` | `multi` | $0 | Broader free; may `MCP_NEEDS_PLANNER_REPAIR` |
| **L3** | `standard` | `multi` | ~$0.22 | Real audit — user-approved, install verified |
| L4 | `deep` | `multi` + `confirmDeep: true` | higher | User explicitly wants max rigor |

**L3 template:**
```
tier: standard
mode: multi
skill: code_intelligence
prompt: [numbered P0/P1, max 5-8, file:line]
fileContext: === file1.lua ===\n[FULL TEXT]\n\n=== file2.lua ===\n[FULL TEXT]
```

### `megalens_poll` — get results

| Param | Required | Rules |
|-------|----------|-------|
| `run_id` | **YES** | UUID from `megalens_debate`. Poll until `terminal: true`. Use `poll_after_ms` between calls. |

**Watch:** `partial_metrics.files_mapped` — **0 means fileContext failed**. `billing.cost_usd` on terminal.

### `megalens_history` — list past runs

| Param | Required | Default | Rules |
|-------|----------|---------|-------|
| `limit` | No | `10` | Integer 1–50. Use when `run_id` lost or before retry. |

### `megalens_status` — server config OR poll

| Param | Required | Behavior |
|-------|----------|----------|
| `run_id` | No | **No id:** server/plan info. **With id:** poll (prefer `megalens_poll` for runs). |

---

## `fileContext` — non-negotiable

| Payload | Result |
|---------|--------|
| Paths only | `MCP_BLOCKED` — $0 |
| Header line only | `files_mapped: 0` — useless |
| 5+ files ~200k chars | Often `MCP_NEEDS_PLANNER_REPAIR` |
| **2–3 files ~60–120k** | Best hit rate |

**QT bundles (one per run):**
- Map: `quest_tracker_map.lua` + `quest_tracker.lua` + `quest_tracker_plugins.lua`
- Wiring/UI: `quest_tracker.lua` + `quest_tracker_plugins.lua` + `quest_tracker_window.lua`
- Steps: `quest_tracker_cache.lua` + `quest_tracker_steps.lua` + `quest_data_loader.lua`

Read files from disk → concatenate with `=== filename ===` headers.

---

## When to call (gates)

**Default = $0 static audit first** (logs, grep, SKILL.md, in-game repro).

**Call L3 only when ALL pass:**
- [ ] User approved spend: `run standard megalens, I accept ~$0.22` (or explicit `megalens_debate` request)
- [ ] Game log `mod loaded vX.Y.Z` = workspace `MOD_VERSION`
- [ ] Log shows `[QT] startup: state=` (not mid-crash / wipe-only)
- [ ] Concrete P0/P1 list (not "audit everything")
- [ ] FAIL streak ≥ 3 on same feature OR user stuck after real repro

**Do NOT call:**
- Builder SHIP HANDOFF intake (static only)
- Stale Fluffy install (log version mismatch)
- Wiped log with no play session
- First look at broken mod before static pass

---

## Workflow

```
1. Pre-flight ($0): logs + version + static grep + P0/P1 list
2. Read 2-3 files → build fileContext (full text)
3. megalens_debate → save run_id
4. megalens_poll loop until terminal: true
5. If files_mapped=0 → fix fileContext; do NOT retry same payload
6. megalens_history before any retry
7. Present: agreed / disputed / novel findings + billing.cost_usd
8. BUILDER HANDOFF — P0/P1, file:line, BEFORE/AFTER (auditor does not edit lua)
```

---

## Status codes

| Status | Charged? | Action |
|--------|----------|--------|
| `MCP_BLOCKED` | No | Paste real code in `fileContext` |
| `MCP_NEEDS_PLANNER_REPAIR` | No | Smaller bundle; sharper prompt |
| `MCP_APPROVED` | Yes ~$0.12–0.30 | Hand off P0/P1 to Builder |
| `MCP_ABORTED_TIMEOUT` | varies | Shrink fileContext (~600s cap) |
| `running` | Not yet | Keep polling 1–3 min typical |

**Retry:** Never same blocked payload. Max **one L3 retry per session** without user re-approval.

---

## Presenting results

- Do **not** collapse to one summary
- Split: engines agree / disputed / novel vs your prior view
- If `report.suggested: true` → offer `.md` report using `report.sections` + `report.suggestedFilename`
- Say explicitly if MegaLens changed your hypothesis

**Propose L3 voice:**
> **LET'S MEGALENSE THIS SHIT UP.** Level 3 (~$0.22). [feature area]. Say: `run standard megalens, I accept ~$0.22`

